\",FontWeight->\"Bold\",FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.4000152590218967, \
0.2]]\)\!\(\*StyleBox[\"Equations\",FontWeight->\"Bold\",FontColor->RGBColor[\
0.6, 0.4000152590218967, \
0.2]]\)\!\(\*StyleBox[\":\",FontWeight->\"Bold\",FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, \
0.4000152590218967, 0.2]]\) An exact solution to the \[CapitalLambda] vacuum \
field equations that has (1) free parameter a, (2) \[GothicCapitalC] = 1, and \
(3) parameter \[ScriptCapitalA] such that \[ScriptCapitalA](t) = \
\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(c\), \(2\)]\) is the Friedmann Continuity Equation \
(which generates the a(t) formula).\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]",
