\\(\[Mu]\[Nu]\\)]\\) matrix used is a diagonal matrix. Since off-diagonal \\!\
\\(\\*SubscriptBox[\\(R\\), \\(\[Mu]\[Nu]\\)]\\) equations rarely appear, \
almost all the equations are expressed by dividing out \\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[\
\\(g\\), \\(\[Mu]\[Nu]\\)]\\).\"\>"], "Print",
