Cell[BoxData["\<\"I call this solution (having free parameter \
\[GothicCapitalC]) the Free-gauge FLRW (FG-FLRW) solution. \\n\\nIn these \
notebooks the name FLRW is used only for 4D. Similar solutions in \
\\n5D\[Dash]7D are referred to as Generalized Robertson-Walker (GRW), and \
solutions \\nhaving free parameter \[GothicCapitalC] are referred to as \
Free-gauge Generalized \\nRobertson-Walker (FG-GRW).\"\>"], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{
